ears and months",[254,286,287,289,290,264,292,294],{},[257,288,273],{}," is the total number of months, and ",[257,291,263],{},[257,293,267],{}," are the split years and months (0–11); the three bindings stay in sync.",[296,297],"component-example",{"name":298},"months-basic",[300,301,302,306,309],"ul",{},[303,304,305],"li",{},"Only non-negative integers are accepted. The value carries over only after focus leaves the whole group (moving focus between years and months does not commit, so both can be cleared together): 0 years 13 months becomes 1 year 1 month, 13 months in total.",[303,307,308],{},"The three bindings can be used alone or together. When the parent fills in total months and years\u002Fmonths that conflict, total months win; when only years\u002Fmonths are filled in, they are summed again and carried over.",[303,310,311,312,315,316,319],{},"An empty side counts as 0; when both are empty, all three bindings are ",[257,313,314],{},"null",". Strings, negative numbers, decimals, ",[257,317,318],{},"NaN"," or values beyond the safe integer range from the parent count as empty.",[281,321,323],{"id":322},"narrow-containers","Narrow containers",[254,325,326],{},"When the container is too narrow for both the years and months inputs, it switches to a single \"total months\" input; with enough width it goes back to both inputs, keeping any input not yet committed.",[296,328],{"name":329},"months-compact",[281,331,333],{"id":332},"variants","Variants",[254,335,336,337,264,340,343,344,347],{},"Uses the ",[257,338,339],{},"color",[257,341,342],{},"highlight"," of ",[257,345,346],{},"UInput",", applied to every input.",[296,349],{"name":350},"months-color",[281,352,354],{"id":353},"size-and-states","Size and states",[254,356,357,358,361],{},"While loading, a spinner shows after the months unit and input is disabled. The year and month units switch with the locale (\"yr\" and \"mo\" in English, \"年\" and \"月\" in Traditional Chinese); their width follows the text, and 